  "updated_at": "2026-03-03",
  "bio": "Alena Maya is a distinguished tattoo artist based in Poznan, Poland, specializing in the illustrative style that brings each piece of art to life with vivid detail and creative flair. Renowned for her professionalism, Alena ensures that every client's experience is comfortable and that their individual vision is translated into ink with precision and care. Her studio is a bastion of cleanliness, maintaining the highest standards of hygiene to ensure a safe and trustful environment for all her artwork.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Poznan, Woj. Wielkopolskie, Poland"
}